        "Description": "Sept. 25, 2006.\r\rBangkok, Thailandia.\r\rCiao, agente 47. Today the next stronzi are Rodrigo Santoro, Heidi Santoro, Rodrigo Santo, Stefano &quot;Steve&quot; Albino &amp; Alberto &quot;Al&quot; D&apos;Andrea. Signora Santoro, Signor Santo &amp; Albino  is in the building where Giordano Carra&apos;s music setup is located. And Signor Santoro is over in the opposite building, in one of the lounges . D&apos;Andrea is outside behind the hotel buildings. After todat there is only twenty nemici left.\r\rGrazie mille.\r\r-&apos;Don&apos; Angelo Corleone",
